sequenceDiagram
  actor RM as Relationship Manager
  participant UI as Browser (pages.js)
  participant API as api.py
  participant AC as auth.py
  participant MM as ModelManager
  participant DB as DataStore
  RM->>UI: fill form, click Predict
  UI->>API: POST /api/predict (X-CSRF-Token)
  API->>AC: check session, role, CSRF
  AC-->>API: allowed
  API->>API: validate values against BOUNDS
  alt invalid input
    API-->>UI: 400 error message
  else valid
    API->>MM: predict_proba + explain
    MM-->>API: probability, factors
    API->>API: risk_tier, suggest_actions
    API->>DB: audit(predict_adhoc)
    API-->>UI: probability, tier, factors, actions
    UI-->>RM: result panel
  end
